## The radio room, after

::bg{location="radio_room" time="morning"}
::use{component="enter" who="sol" side="right" instance="use-001"}
@sol{code="0010" emotion="neutral"}: Hey. Sixty-eight, if you were wondering. The count.
@sol{code="0020" emotion="sad"}: It's fine. I said it wasn't a big deal. I say a lot of things.

<branch id="sorry" prompt="He's winding the same cable around his hand.">
  <choice id="apologise" label="Apologise, properly">
    ::set{run.aff.sol += 1}
    @sol{code="0030" emotion="shy"}: ...Okay. Thanks. Next time wake me if I'm asleep, and I'll do the same.
  </choice>
  <choice id="excuse" label="Say you fell asleep over the log">
    @sol{code="0040" emotion="neutral"}: The log. Right. It is a very good log.
  </choice>
</branch>
